  "10.40.30.20(1)": {
   "explanation": "In the RS zone the minimum lot frontage is the \"f\" number on the zone label, or 15.0 m if none. Each lot of a semi-detached pair needs half that. On a major street, a street-fronting townhouse needs 6.0 m per unit (less 1.0 m per unit without its own driveway), and other townhouses need 30.0 m.",
